  m_Text: 'in this game you need to be vigilant and change the color of the protective
    ball to the corresponding flying one to get a point and not get damaged, to change
    the color of the ball you need to press the color change button, to change the
    direction of the ball you need to press anywhere on the screen. The essence of
    the game is to survive as long as possible and get the most points.

    Good
    luck and enjoy the game!'
